Package: telegraf-light
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: NapiLab <info@napilab.ru>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: adduser
Provides: telegraf (= @UPSTREAM@)
Conflicts: telegraf
Replaces: telegraf
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/lab240/telegraf-ligth
Description: Telegraf agent with a reduced plugin set
 Telegraf @UPSTREAM@ built with the plugins NaPi devices use: inputs cpu, mem,
 disk, diskio, net, system, temp, modbus, snmp, mqtt_consumer, output
 influxdb_v2, parsers json, json_v2, influx, value.
 .
 About 22 MB on disk and 20 MB RSS instead of 300 MB and 140 MB of the full
 build. Drop-in replacement for the telegraf package: same service, user and
 config paths.
